    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88604" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσανα-τρίβω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rub upon</i> or <i>against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς δένδροις τὰ κέρατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					6.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>rub oneself upon</i> or <i>against</i> a person,
				<i>exercise oneself with</i> or <i>against</i> another,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				27.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.751f
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>try a fall</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				169c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rub as well</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθονίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cleopatra
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.404
			</span></i>; <i>massage as well</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.103
			</span></i>.</div>
